=== ROOM 56: THE PROCESS CONTROLLER ===

Rogue agent processes are multiplying in the background.
Find them, read their secrets, and terminate them in the correct order.

MISSION:
1. Launch the agents: ./launch_agents.sh
2. Find all agent processes: pgrep -a agent
3. Read the keeper log: cat /tmp/agent_keeper.log
4. Kill the keeper: pkill -f agent_keeper.sh
5. Kill all remaining agents: pkill -f agent_worker.sh
6. Validate: ./getKey.sh

KEY COMMANDS:
   pgrep name             Find PIDs by name
   pgrep -l name          Show PID and name
   pgrep -a name          Show PID and full command
   pgrep -f pattern       Match full command line
   pkill name             Send SIGTERM to matching processes
   pkill -9 name          Force kill (SIGKILL)
   pkill -f pattern       Kill by full command line
   nohup cmd &            Run immune to hangups
   nohup cmd > out.log 2>&1 &  With output capture
   nice -n 10 cmd         Lower priority execution
   renice -n 5 -p PID     Change priority of running process
   killall name           Kill all by name
   wait PID               Wait for process to finish

To access the Exit Exam after completing the Bonus Track:
   openssl enc -aes-256-cbc -d -a -pbkdf2 \
     -in ../room_100/README -out ../room_100/README.txt -pass pass:masterkey
   cat ../room_100/README.txt
